{"bangumi":{"date":"2023-04-06","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/1d/02/363101_T8SWw.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/1d/02/363101_T8SWw.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/1d/02/363101_T8SWw.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/1d/02/363101_T8SWw.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/1d/02/363101_T8SWw.jpg"},"summary":"自全人类被神秘现象瞬间石化之后，已过去了几千年——\r\n千空，一个有着超越常人的头脑，彻头彻尾的科学少年醒来了。\r\n面对着文明已经灭绝的石之世界，千空决心以科学的力量重建地球，他找来了同伴，建立起了“科学王国”。\r\n但是，他们碰上了由灵长类最强高中生狮子王司统领的“武力帝国”。\r\n司为了净化人类，决心以强大的武力，阻止科学的发展。\r\n经过科学与武力的大战，千空等人的科学王国取得优势，两国最终和解。\r\n司因为背叛而陷入了冷冻睡眠状态，而千空为了复活全人类，决心率领科学王国前往石化光线的产生地——地球另一头的新世界。\r\n迈向全世界，解开石化之谜！\r\n石世界的大航海时代终于拉开了序幕！","name":"Dr.STONE NEW WORLD","name_cn":"石纪元 新世界","tags":[{"name":"科幻","count":847,"total_count":250598},{"name":"2023年4月","count":746,"total_count":35425},{"name":"热血","count":716,"total_count":211416},{"name":"漫画改","count":687,"total_count":854569},{"name":"TV","count":456,"total_count":1393151},{"name":"新石纪","count":348,"total_count":1601},{"name":"漫改","count":331,"total_count":359455},{"name":"2023","count":308,"total_count":81186},{"name":"科普","count":295,"total_count":12761},{"name":"TMS","count":289,"total_count":18278},{"name":"续作","count":233,"total_count":45642},{"name":"搞笑","count":167,"total_count":633807},{"name":"JUMP","count":163,"total_count":33279},{"name":"战斗","count":117,"total_count":466275},{"name":"日本","count":92,"total_count":291711},{"name":"松下周平","count":55,"total_count":244},{"name":"科学","count":35,"total_count":2305},{"name":"冒险","count":32,"total_count":53067},{"name":"石纪元","count":32,"total_count":864},{"name":"日本动画","count":25,"total_count":34806},{"name":"2023年","count":21,"total_count":3587},{"name":"奇幻","count":15,"total_count":465221},{"name":"智斗","count":14,"total_count":22692},{"name":"TMSEntertainment","count":10,"total_count":2296},{"name":"种田","count":9,"total_count":3084},{"name":"Dr.Stone","count":8,"total_count